{
  "name": "Weekly hiring signals to Google Sheets (career-site-jobs)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly hiring signals for a company watchlist\nEvery Monday this reads the roles your watchlist companies published in the last 7 days (Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby, Workable, Personio, Recruitee) with the Apify actor **career-site-jobs**, then writes two Google Sheets tabs:\n- **Jobs**: one row per role, matched on `id`, so a rerun updates rows instead of duplicating them.\n- **Signals**: one row per company per week: roles posted, top departments and countries, remote roles, roles with pay.\n\n### Setup (about 5 minutes)\n1. **Watchlist and filters:** list companies as career page URLs, `system:board` (`greenhouse:discord`) or bare board names.\n2. **Read new roles:** create an *Apify API key* credential (Console > Settings > API & Integrations).\n3. Create a Google Sheet with two tabs named **Jobs** and **Signals** (headers are added on the first run). In both Sheets nodes connect Google and pick the spreadsheet.\n4. Run once by hand, then activate.\n\n**Disclosure:** built and sold by the actor's owner. This template runs the paid Apify actor improved_gravity_qb7/greenhouse-lever-ashby-personio-jobs-scraper ($0.003 per job returned).",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "e1124c4b-5124-50db-8739-e4d2de5345c5",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Cost\n$0.003 per role returned. `maxJobs` (500) and *Maximum Cost per Run* ($1.50) cap a run. Roles are counted once per run, filtered to the last 7 days, so cost follows hiring volume, not board size.\n\n### Limits\nCompanies with no new roles get no Signals row. Roles without a publish date are left out. Counts are published postings, not headcount.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 440,
        "color": "5"
      },
      "id": "24694e79-59c8-59fb-84eb-7126e154aff2",
      "name": "Cost and limits",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        -260
      ]
    },
